{"zh":[{"start":4.51,"end":8.78,"text":"在地球历史上，气候就像坐过山车。"},{"start":9.0,"end":11.18,"text":"我们这颗星球的“体温曲线”"},{"start":11.2,"end":14.79,"text":"显示了直到今天的全球气温波动——"},{"start":14.82,"end":18.26,"text":"是根据历史气候数据重建的。"},{"start":22.29,"end":23.7,"text":"一万年前，"},{"start":23.73,"end":27.66,"text":"气温稳定在一个非常平稳的水平上。"},{"start":28.79,"end":30.27,"text":"随着工业化，"},{"start":30.3,"end":34.2,"text":"以及随之而来的大量温室气体排放，"},{"start":34.23,"end":36.29,"text":"人类结束了这种状态。"},{"start":38.19,"end":40.21,"text":"而从 2010 年起，"},{"start":40.24,"end":44.77,"text":"温度计上升得比人类历史上任何时候都快。"}],"de":[{"start":4.51,"end":8.78,"text":"Im Verlauf der Erdgeschichte glich das Klima einer Achterbahnfahrt.","words":[["Im","在"],["Verlauf","进程"],["der","的"],["Erdgeschichte","地球历史"],["glich","像"],["das","这"],["Klima","气候"],["einer","一次"],["Achterbahnfahrt.","过山车。"]],"reading":"伊姆 费尔劳夫 德尔 埃尔特格席希特 格利希 达斯 克利马 艾纳 阿赫特尔班法尔特。"},{"start":9.0,"end":11.18,"text":"Die „Fieberkurve“ unseres Planeten","words":[["Die","这"],["„Fieberkurve“","“体温曲线”"],["unseres","我们"],["Planeten","星球的"]],"reading":"迪 菲伯尔库尔费 翁泽雷斯 普拉内滕"},{"start":11.2,"end":14.79,"text":"zeigt die globalen Temperaturschwankungen bis heute –","words":[["zeigt","显示"],["die","这"],["globalen","全球"],["Temperaturschwankungen","气温波动"],["bis","直到"],["heute","今天"],["–","–"]],"reading":"灿特 迪 格洛巴伦 滕佩拉图尔施万昆根 比斯 霍伊特"},{"start":14.82,"end":18.26,"text":"rekonstruiert anhand von historischen Klimadaten.","words":[["rekonstruiert","重建"],["anhand","根据"],["von","的"],["historischen","历史"],["Klimadaten.","气候数据。"]],"reading":"雷孔斯特鲁伊尔特 安汉特 冯 希斯托里申 克利马达滕。"},{"start":22.29,"end":23.7,"text":"Vor 10.000 Jahren","words":[["Vor","前"],["10.000","10,000"],["Jahren","年"]],"reading":"福尔 岑陶森德 雅伦"},{"start":23.73,"end":27.66,"text":"pendelte sich die Temperatur auf ein bemerkenswert stabiles Niveau ein.","words":[["pendelte","稳定"],["sich","自己"],["die","这"],["Temperatur","气温"],["auf","在"],["ein","一个"],["bemerkenswert","非常"],["stabiles","稳定的"],["Niveau","水平"],["ein.","下来。"]],"reading":"彭德尔特 西希 迪 滕佩拉图尔 奥